cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Ratchet: license-clean distillation on open models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bhanushali
    given-names: Harsh
repository-code: "https://github.com/harshbhx/ratchet"
url: "https://ratchet.dualmindlab.tech"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.5.1
date-released: 2026-10-29
abstract: >-
  Ratchet is an OpenAI-compatible gateway in which a small student model answers first and a teacher whose license allows
  distillation answers when the student is unsure, logging each answer with its teacher and license. Every night it is
  designed to train a new LoRA adapter on those answers and release it only if it passes a statistical gate.
keywords:
  - distillation
  - LLM gateway
  - LoRA
  - Nemotron
  - text-to-SQL
  - tool calling
  - license provenance
